  "releaseNotes": "`GitOps.moveFile`: move a file or folder within a worktree using `git mv`.\nInitial release: remote-agnostic git operations (`GitOps`) parameterised by `GitAuth`, the `IForgeClient` abstraction, and a GitHub implementation (`GhForgeClient`) built on the `gh` CLI.\nResolved nullness warnings: a failed process start or an undeterminable clone parent directory now produces a clear error instead of a null dereference.",
